+0.9.0-preview.6 build status
+============================
+
+This package contains the fully integrated preview.6 source tree. It is not an IL patch and it does not reuse a preview.3/preview.5 executable.
+
+To build on Windows:
+1. Install the .NET 8 SDK.
+2. Install Microsoft Edge WebView2 Evergreen Runtime.
+3. Extract the whole source ZIP.
+4. Double-click BUILD_PREVIEW.cmd.
+5. The script restores, builds, publishes, runs the built-in self-test, and writes hashes under artifacts\.
+
+The current packaging environment did not have a usable .NET SDK and could not download one, so no EXE is claimed or included here. Static source validation, JavaScript syntax validation, protocol tests, and launcher-format validation were completed before packaging.
+
+Important release boundary:
+- Normal review save uses the new v2 pipeline.
+- Delete is intentionally disabled in both the frontend and the WebMessage whitelist.
+- Use the Douban website for deletion until the stage-2 delete transaction is implemented.
